      "title": "Removed formatPrice still imported by cart",
      "description": "This change removes the formatPrice export from src/money.ts. src/cart.ts still imports formatPrice on line 1 and calls it on line 8. The TypeScript build fails, and cartTotal cannot show a cart total to customers. Update src/cart.ts to call formatMoney with a currency. Another option is to keep formatPrice as a wrapper around formatMoney.",
